# Milestone discipline

- Milestone 1 (deterministic domain engine) is frozen once committed.
- M2 = Playwright **read-only** discovery of an **explicitly supplied** restaurant admin URL only. No host guessing.
- M2 must not submit forms, click save/update, or mutate menu data.
- M3 = WRITE + READ-BACK against canary only, after M2 approval.
- Do not start the next milestone without explicit human approval.
